{
  "_comment": [
    "Habbo Hogwarts, as recorded in the connection spreadsheet. This file is",
    "the transcription of it, and it is the map's source of truth — the",
    "positions on the drawing are a picture of this, not the other way round.",
    "",
    "Room ids are the sheet's own R-numbers and connection ids its C-numbers,",
    "so any row here can be checked against the row it came from without",
    "anybody having to work out which is which.",
    "",
    "`zone` and `floor` are NOT in the sheet. They are read off the room",
    "names, which are written to a strict pattern — 'Hogwarts - 3rd Floor",
    "Corridor (2)' says its own floor — and they exist because the layout has",
    "to put the castle's seven floors in seven bands and Hogsmeade somewhere",
    "else entirely. tools/layout-hogwarts.js is what uses them.",
    "",
    "Two spellings are kept exactly as the sheet has them, rather than",
    "quietly corrected: 'Potions Clasroom' and 'Dogweed and Deatcap'. If they",
    "are typos they should be fixed in the sheet and re-transcribed, so that",
    "the two never disagree; a fix applied only here would be invisible."
  ],
